  "id": "van_richtens_tower_interior",
  "name": "Van Richten's Tower",
  "region": "van_richtens_tower",
  "summary": "Four round rooms stacked inside the black tower: the archmage's old hall, now a hunter's storeroom, with the clay figures that work the lift; a workroom of notes and maps; a lantern room where Van Richten keeps what matters, behind a ward that smells of thunderstorms; and above it his own room.",
  "text": "Stone stairs wind up inside the wall. Every room is tidy in the way of a man who expects to leave in a hurry.",
